overview:
24* 10/100/1000M PoE Ports+2*Gigabit Uplink+2* Gigabit SFP Ports；
Comply with IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u, IEEE802.3ab Standard;
Ethernet Ports support 10/100/1000M self- adaptive;
The AI mode is automatically enabled 10M speed for Ports 17~24 in Extend mode;
POE priority is supported, from port 1 to port 16, which is enabled by default；
Flow control mode: IEEE 802.3X standard for full duplex, and Back Pressure standard for half duplex;
Zero configuration feature, automatically supplied to adaptive equipment;
Panel indicator monitoring status and help failure analysis;
With DIP switch, support Default and Extend modes;
Support port lightning surge: common mode 4KV, differential mode 2KV; Electrostatic ESD: air 8KV, contact 6KV.

